or","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those years. In 2025, August to September ran 49% of normal on the middle, and in 2026 so far March to April came in at 261%. Grid 29584 had its driest year in 1989 at 69%.</p>"}
